 = ROUTE_EN & ADDR3. Addresses 000..111 select S1..S8." (at 20.32 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 0b739eec-5cc3-50c1-8d10-1d09f548d57e))(text "Dedicated return: external contact -> RETURN_LOAD -> existing monitor 2 ohm shunt -> RETURN_DRIVER -> current-driver B_BR." (at 20.32 307.34 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 28e622f2-21c2-5e8f-973a-0a4f6752c83d))(text "Do not bypass the monitor, add a second shunt, tie the two returns, or use recording REF/BIAS as a stimulation return." (at 20.32 314.96 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 28fc5f8f-a486-59ce-9913-0181367fecbb))(text "TMUX6208 is rail-to-rail at valid 24 V supply; powered-off, stuck-on, parasitic coupling and two-source shared tissue paths remain unqualified." (at 20.32 322.58 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 149c6c6f-e89d-5b88-9aa8-122e79db0b9a))(text "A_ROUTER needs external terminal guard qualification before connection to A_BR. Internal enable-low is only a commanded off state." (at 20.32 330.2 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 0ff545b4-b3d2-5229-9312-9ce5a0f18813)))
